<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/" version="2.0"><channel><title>纽约时报 实时热点</title><link>https://rss.nytimes.com/services/xml/rss/nyt/HomePage.xml</link><description>纽约时报 自动中文翻译源</description><docs>http://www.rssboard.org/rss-specification</docs><generator>python-feedgen</generator><lastBuildDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 12:20:02 +0000</lastBuildDate><item><title>特朗普对市场上英伟达的飙升感到高兴。它并没有持续多久。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html</link><description>最近几天股市的回落表明，特朗普总统推动重新任命公司首席执行官的努力与他其他政策的现实发生了冲突。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html'&gt;特朗普对市场上英伟达的飙升感到高兴。它并没有持续多久。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump Rejoiced in the Market’s Nvidia Surge. It Didn’t Last Long.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/us/politics/trump-nvidia-stock-market.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 01:53:20 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>特朗普试图削弱华为。现在它是中国人工智能的核心推。</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/huawei-trump-china-ai.html</link><description>随着中国获得英伟达先进芯片的机会减少，尽管华为与美国竞争对手存在巨大技术差距，但它对北京来说变得越来越不可或缺。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/huawei-trump-china-ai.html'&gt;特朗普试图削弱华为。现在它是中国人工智能的核心推。&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Trump Tried to Cripple Huawei. Now It Is Central to China’s A.I. Push.&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/business/huawei-trump-china-ai.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:01:56 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>两党都希望监管人工智能在国会面临障碍</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/ai-regulation-congress-nvidia.html</link><description>两党成员均表示，他们希望解决人工智能政策问题，但立法步伐缓慢和地盘之争可能会成为障碍。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/ai-regulation-congress-nvidia.html'&gt;两党都希望监管人工智能在国会面临障碍&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Bipartisan Desire to Regulate A.I. Faces Obstacles in Congress&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/26/us/politics/ai-regulation-congress-nvidia.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 10:03:47 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>周六感恩节游行。他们能做到吗？</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/thanksgiving-parade-new-york-postponed.html</link><description>经过一个多世纪的传统后，梅西百货感恩节游行突然变得灵活起来。当然，这很好。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/thanksgiving-parade-new-york-postponed.html'&gt;周六感恩节游行。他们能做到吗？&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：The Thanksgiving Parade on Saturday. Can They Do That?&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/thanksgiving-parade-new-york-postponed.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:45:29 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>梅西百货感恩节大游行影响游客假期计划</title><link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-tourists.html</link><description>由于强风暴袭击纽约，游行被推迟到周六，届时该市的许多游客计划前往其他地方。&lt;hr&gt;&lt;b&gt;报道出处：&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• [纽约时报] &lt;a href='https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-tourists.html'&gt;梅西百货感恩节大游行影响游客假期计划&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;small&gt;原文：Macy’s Thanksgiving Day Parade Sours Holiday Plans for Tourists&lt;/small&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/11/25/nyregion/macys-thanksgiving-day-parade-tourists.html</guid><pubDate>Thu, 26 Nov 2026 02:24:38 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>